{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Do not swallow inline MDC restoration failures.** Once the selected result is settled, this ignores every non-JVM-fatal restoration failure from an inline executor, allowing the caller thread to continue with cleared, corrupted, or leaked MDC. Attempt a reliable fallback such as `MDC.clear()`, and fail the invocation if clean restoration cannot be established.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77QAUh","finding_digest":"51b3110768aa57a025405e5f29773d4785c5995e5de3fc606cd430926b507f01","finding_id":"arf_v1_kgzrcb3ivjl2ajkalzpss5z5i6","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::inline-mdc-restoration-leak","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::supplyhandler::inline-mdc-restoration-leak","line":292,"observation_digest":"7746358313944e9ed2f75052649d57d99857d15703dff5126660e8eacdf6bc6e","observation_id":"aro_v1_o5ddlaytsrhj5uxxkbjgjhkx3g","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/DurableExecutor.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_kgzrcb3ivjl2ajkalzpss5z5i6","published_at":"2026-10-08T05:44:12Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ujohmip6mlep7p7lfksixhq4vk","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"00c12717417954984b3c3dea73b86b1cbb241039","reviewer":"codex","start_line":290,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_qwqmj2ns3hyevv2jvz7evu6gcq","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T05:44:12Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
